OL,3,AExtra 200 police aid crash and fire
OL,4,Adeaths force
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn extra 200 police officers are being
OL,7,Fsent to support an investigation into a
OL,8,Fcar crash and a house fire which left
OL,9,Fnine people dead, a council leader has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FSeven people, including two police
OL,13,Fofficers, died in the crash at South
OL,14,FBank near Middlesbrough on Saturday,
OL,15,Ffollowed by a house fire in Grangetown
OL,16,Fon Wednesday that claimed the lives of
OL,17,Fa woman aged 34 and a seven-year-old
OL,18,Fgirl.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
